olves this exact ${target.title} versus ${mechanism.title} interaction.`]
    ];
    return {
      primary: target,
      related: unique([mechanism, ...linked(target), ...linked(mechanism)], entry => entry.id),
      html: answerFrame(
        `${target.title} versus ${mechanism.title}`,
        "There is not enough direct canon evidence for an unconditional yes-or-no verdict.",
        factors,
        { status: "Conditional matchup analysis", note: "Rather than turning a missing feat into a made-up certainty, the engine identifies the variables that the question leaves unspecified." }
    